  ## Request — `GetBoardRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` | Empty: the current period |
  | `level_id` | `string` | Empty: every level |
  | `subject` | `string` | Literal scale: an area name, to break the performance down by its competencies |
  | `from` | `string` | Attendance range; empty: the last ninety days of the period |
  | `to` | `string` |  |

